I"�A<h3 id="어떤-문제인가">어떤 문제인가</h3>

<p>8명이 일렬로 서서 사진을 찍는데, 각자 “누구와 몇 칸 떨어져 서고 싶다”는 조건을 제시한다.
<strong>모든 조건을 만족하는 배치가 몇 가지인지</strong> 세는 문제다.</p>

<p>조건은 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">N~F=0</code> 같은 다섯 글자 문자열로 주어진다.</p>

<ul>
  <li>1번째 글자: 조건을 낸 사람</li>
  <li>3번째 글자: 상대방</li>
  <li>4번째 글자: <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">=</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">&lt;</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">&gt;</code> 중 하나</li>
  <li>5번째 글자: 간격 (0~6)</li>
</ul>

<p>여기서 <strong>간격은 두 사람 사이에 있는 다른 사람의 수</strong>다. 자리 인덱스 차이가 아니라는 게 중요하다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="입력-형식에서-얻는-정보">입력 형식에서 얻는 정보</h3>

<p>이 문제는 입력 형식을 자세히 봐야 실수를 안 할 수 있다.
문제 본문에는 명시되어 있지 않지만, <strong>서는 인원이 총 8명</strong>이라는 것과 비교 연산자가 세 종류뿐이라는 것을 입력 형식에서 읽어낼 수 있다.</p>

<p>8명이면 가능한 배치는 8! = 40,320가지다. 전부 만들어 확인해도 충분한 규모라 <strong>완전 탐색(순열)</strong> 으로 접근했다.
같은 사람이 두 번 설 수는 없으므로 조합이 아니라 순열이다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="접근-방식">접근 방식</h3>

<p>문자열 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">"ACFJMNRT"</code>의 모든 순열을 만드는 함수를 작성하고, 만들어진 배치가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">data</code>의 조건을 모두 만족하면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">++answer</code>를 해주었다.</p>

<p>순열은 <strong>swap 후 재귀, 그리고 다시 swap으로 되돌리는</strong> 백트래킹 방식으로 만들었다.</p>

<div class="language-c++ highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">start</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;=</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="n">swap</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">start</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]);</span>
    <span class="n">stringFriends</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">start</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">);</span>
    <span class="n">swap</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">start</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]);</span>   <span class="c1">// 원상 복구</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>두 번째 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">swap</code>이 빠지면 다음 반복이 오염된 상태에서 시작해 배치가 중복되거나 누락된다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="간격-계산에서--1을-하는-이유">간격 계산에서 -1을 하는 이유</h3>

<div class="language-c++ highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">distance</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">]);</span>
<span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'0'</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">...</span>
<span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">abs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">distance</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="n">num</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">find</code>로 두 사람의 자리 인덱스를 구해 차이를 낸 뒤, <strong>절댓값에서 1을 뺀다.</strong></p>

<p>인접해 있으면 인덱스 차이는 1인데 사이에 낀 사람은 0명이다. 문제에서 말하는 간격은 후자이므로 1을 빼야 맞는다.
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">abs</code>를 쓰는 건 누가 왼쪽인지 오른쪽인지는 상관이 없기 때문이다.</p>

<p>이 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">-1</code>을 빠뜨리면 모든 조건이 한 칸씩 밀려서 답이 전부 틀린다. 이 문제에서 가장 많이 실수하는 지점이라고 생각한다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="시간-복잡도">시간 복잡도</h3>

<p>순열 8! = 40,320개를 만들고, 각 배치마다 조건 최대 100개를 확인한다.
조건 하나를 볼 때 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">find</code>가 문자열을 훑으므로 상수에 가까운 비용이 붙어, 전체 <strong>400만 번</strong> 정도다. 제한 안에 들어온다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="풀이-코드">풀이 코드</h3>

<div class="language-c++ highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="cp">#include &lt;string&gt;
#include &lt;vector&gt;
#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;
</span>
<span class="k">using</span> <span class="k">namespace</span> <span class="n">std</span><span class="p">;</span>

<span class="kt">void</span> <span class="nf">stringFriends</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">string</span><span class="o">&amp;</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">start</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">vector</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">string</span><span class="o">&gt;&amp;</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">int</span><span class="o">&amp;</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">start</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="kt">bool</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="k">auto</span> <span class="n">d</span> <span class="o">:</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
            <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">distance</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">find</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">]);</span>
            <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">num</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="sc">'0'</span><span class="p">;</span>

            <span class="k">switch</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">])</span> <span class="p">{</span>
            <span class="k">case</span> <span class="sc">'='</span><span class="p">:</span>
                <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">abs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">distance</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="n">num</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">else</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
            <span class="k">case</span> <span class="sc">'&lt;'</span><span class="p">:</span>
                <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">abs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">distance</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">num</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">else</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
            <span class="k">case</span> <span class="sc">'&gt;'</span><span class="p">:</span>
                <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">abs</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">distance</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span> <span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">num</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">true</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">else</span> <span class="n">tf</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nb">false</span><span class="p">;</span>
                <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
            <span class="p">}</span>
            <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="o">!</span><span class="n">tf</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
        <span class="p">}</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">tf</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">++</span><span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>
    <span class="k">else</span> <span class="p">{</span>
        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">start</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;=</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="o">++</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
            <span class="n">swap</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">start</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]);</span>
            <span class="n">stringFriends</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">start</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">);</span>
            <span class="n">swap</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">start</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]);</span>
        <span class="p">}</span>
    <span class="p">}</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="kt">int</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">vector</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">string</span><span class="o">&gt;</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
    <span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">friends</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">"ACFJMNRT"</span><span class="p">;</span>
    
    <span class="n">stringFriends</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">size</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">);</span>

    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p><br /></p>

<h3 id="풀고-나서-알게-된-것">풀고 나서 알게 된 것</h3>

<p>다른 분들의 풀이를 보고 두 가지를 배웠다.</p>

<p><strong>1. 조건 검사는 bool 함수로 빼는 게 낫다.</strong>
조건을 만족할 때마다 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">++cnt</code>를 하고 마지막에 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">if (cnt == data.size())</code>로 확인하는 방식보다, 조건 하나라도 어긋나면 바로 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">return false</code> 하는 편이 훨씬 빠르다.
40,320개 배치 × 조건 100개를 전부 도는 것과, 대부분 첫 조건에서 걸러지는 것의 차이다.</p>

<p><strong>2. 순열은 직접 만들 필요가 없다.</strong>
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">algorithm</code> 라이브러리의 <a href="http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/algorithm/next_permutation/">next_permutation</a>을 쓰면 재귀 함수 없이 순열을 순회할 수 있다.</p>

<div class="language-c++ highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="n">string</span> <span class="n">friends</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">"ACFJMNRT"</span><span class="p">;</span>   <span class="c1">// 반드시 정렬된 상태에서 시작</span>
<span class="k">do</span> <span class="p">{</span>
    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">check</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">data</span><span class="p">))</span> <span class="o">++</span><span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">;</span>
<span class="p">}</span> <span class="k">while</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">next_permutation</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">begin</span><span class="p">(),</span> <span class="n">friends</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">end</span><span class="p">()));</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>단 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">next_permutation</code>은 <strong>사전순으로 다음 순열</strong>을 만들기 때문에 시작 문자열이 정렬되어 있어야 전부 순회한다.
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">"ACFJMNRT"</code>는 이미 알파벳 순이라 그대로 쓸 수 있다.</p>

<p><br /><br /></p>

